Bundled fonts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tortie bundles two monospace families and offers them in Settings, Appearance,
Font. Neither is the default. The System preset ships no font bytes and draws
Menlo, which is already on the Mac. Four files ship, being the regular and the
bold member of each family.

  src/renderer/assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.woff2       92,164 bytes
  src/renderer/assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Bold.woff2          94,588 bytes
  src/renderer/assets/fonts/SourceCodePro-Regular.otf.woff2   76,348 bytes
  src/renderer/assets/fonts/SourceCodePro-Bold.otf.woff2      77,372 bytes

